<title>USA: Firstbank of Illinois completes purchase.</title>
<headline>Firstbank of Illinois completes purchase.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Ill. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Firstbank of Illinois Co said Wednesday it completed the acquisition of BankCentral Corp and its wholly owned Central National Bank of Mattoon, Ill.</p>
<p>The transaction included an exchange of Firstbank common stock and cash totaling $13 million, of which common stock accounted for 51 percent.</p>
<p>Central National Bank has total assets of about $110 million.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
